Z||000000||jlhuber||02-22-2000||05:44 PM||||is anyone else having the same problem as i of finding mistakes in the chilton's manual?  first i found that they misspelled EGR as FGR, that one i will give them because the printing press may have failed on the E causing it to look like a F.  but now, i have discovered that the firing order for the 2.8 in the chilton's manual is wrong, it is off by one position on the distributor.  to get it right, i need to turn the numbers on the distributor one position clockwise.  what i am trying to say is the true #1 position on the car is the #2 in the book.  anyway, i find very unpleasant that i purchased a repair manual that is supposed to help me fix it, not further my problems.  anyone with similar occurences, or did i somehow happen to buy the one freak manual that got stuck with all the imperfections?||||reg||13
Z||000001||Cliff Pennock||02-22-2000||07:20 PM||||Yes, I noticed long time ago the firing order was wrong... Since then I've thrown out the Chilton manual.||||reg||13
Z||000002||Monkeyman||02-22-2000||08:25 PM||||Even an uneducated (non-mechanic type) guy like me has seen some of the mistakes in the Chiltons manual.  I kept mine because it still knows more than I do.||||reg||1
Z||000003||FreshAir||02-22-2000||11:17 PM||||I guess I avoided that problem by spending the extra (HA!) $60 to buy the GM service manual.||||reg||1
Z||000004||fierospeeder||02-23-2000||12:12 AM||||I have all three, service manual, haynes and chiltons.  I like having as much literature cause it helps me fix my cars and the idea is like going to a mechanic for advice, the more you go to, the better idea you have on how to fix it.<P>Chilton uses a lot of the service manual diagrams and haynes doens't do that.  Haynes has the phrase, bring it to a mechanic, its to complicated to explain.  Rear caliper rebuilds, transmissions, eventhough they sell a seperate book on how to fix them.  The service manual is cool because it gives all the info, but it has a brief statements on how to fix it.||||reg||1
